365	// defaultProbeClusterCloneSession deliberately propagates the resolver's errors
366	// unwrapped: ensureClusterCloneSession classifies them (errors.Is / ReauthMessage)
367	// and surfaces the discovery/ambiguous ones verbatim (they are already
368	// user-facing), so wrapping would corrupt the classification and prefix the
369	// message. Hence the nolint:wrapcheck on the return sites below.

